      hu: ["A város 1600 méteres magasságban fekszik, stratégiai kaput alkotva a hegyek felé.", "Csarikár híres a 'Charikar-késekről', amelyek Afganisztán-szerte ismertek.", "A település a Shomali-síkság legnagyobb kereskedelmi központja.", "A közeli Bagram légibázis eredetileg szovjet építésű katonai létesítmény.", "A város Kabultól való távolsága mindössze 65 kilométer északra.", "A lakosság túlnyomó többsége perzsa ajkú tadzsik népcsoportba tartozik.", "A terület Afganisztán egyik legrégebbi folyamatosan lakott vidéke.", "A szőlő mellett a mazsola és az eper a legfontosabb exporttermék."],
      ro: ["Charikar este situat la o altitudine de 1600 metri, la poalele Hindu Kush.", "Orașul este centrul administrativ al provinciei Parwan.", "Podgoriile din jurul orașului sunt printre cele mai productive din țară.", "Baza Bagram, situată la 11 km, a fost cea mai mare bază aeriană aliată.", "Universitatea din Parwan a fost fondată în anul 2002 în acest oraș.", "Traficul prin Pasul Salang este vital pentru aprovizionarea capitalei Kabul.", "Meșteșugarii locali sunt renumiți pentru prelucrarea oțelului damasc.", "Orașul are o populație estimată la peste 170.000 de locuitori."],
      en: ["Charikar sits at an elevation of 1,600 meters on the Shomali Plain.", "The city is located exactly 64 kilometers (40 miles) north of Kabul.", "It is the main market for the grapes and mulberries produced in Parwan.", "The strategic Bagram Airfield is located in the same province near the city.", "Charikar is famous for its traditional handmade knives and swords.", "The Salang Pass, reaching 3,400m altitude, is the main route north from here.", "Parwan University in Charikar provides higher education to the region.", "The city was a major stop on the historic road to the Panjshir Valley."],
